window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Enemies-to-lovers romance. Forbidden magic. Dangerous quests. Mind-blowing twists.</b><br> <br> When Sapphire Hayes learned she was fae, it was shocking enough. <br> <br> Finding out she’s half-fae, half-vampire—a combination that shouldn’t exist—is something else entirely. Because it’s a secret she has to keep from everyone. <br> <br> Even from Riven. The cold, calculating, irresistible winter prince who miraculously let her in.<br> <br> But secrets don’t stay buried forever. Especially not when Sapphire and Riven are forced to stay by each other’s sides—whether they like it or not—running from dark enemies while he trains her to wield her magic.<br> <br> And some betrayals can never be forgiven. <br> <br> Now, Riven won’t even look at her. <br> <br> But war is coming. And as they venture deeper into the unknown, Sapphire will do anything to prove that the girl Riven fell for is still there.<br> <br> In a world where emotions are currency and love is a weakness, how far will the winter prince go to save his kingdom—even if it means breaking Sapphire’s heart and shattering her soul in the process? <br> <br> <b>The Fae Bound fantasy romance series by </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> best-selling author Michelle Madow is perfect for fans of Sarah J. Maas, Cassandra Clare, and Jennifer L. Armentrout. <br> <br> Love is war. Magic is deadly. Betrayal is inevitable. Are you ready? Start listening today!</b></p>"; 
